        "title": "Ai njuan e Zion namthan gai",
        "credits": {
          "translator": null,
          "editor": null
        },
        "contentStatus": "available",
        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Ai njuan e Zion namthan gai,",
            "He guang himdaimei tingkauh;",
            "Ai ning touna machun bamni,",
            "Kandih rianramei thaknga.",
            "",
            "Chorus:",
            "He namthan ringmei ganmei ram,",
            "Guang ram gaimei ai hou ni e;",
            "Tak maknga adang khou bam o,",
            "Tak maknga ata nduang lou o.",
            "",
            "2. Nang bumang !-2 nduang lou datro,",
            "Tan hei rianrana bam khou;",
            "Theimei luangbut khou ai bam e,",
            "Ringsuangmei ram juan nithe.",
            "",
            "3. Ringmei gan khou kandih ta jaolo,",
            "Rianramei muang !-2 jing bam;",
            "Kandih rianramei ninga kap,",
            "Guangdih ta machun na huai.",
            "",
            "4. Ata sumlou o he poubaumei,",
            "Theipui nung kiu neila khang;",
            "Njianmei !-2 suthan lou o,",
            "Zion ram niu juan dikho."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
